# Save-anchor for exploration past the Mundania opening.
#
# Plays the whole published route to the end of the opening and then saves,
# so that later probes can `include lib/boot.xit` + `lib/restore_slot1.xit`
# and be in the same state for ~2 billion instructions instead of ~20.
#
# This is an exploration convenience only. The walkthrough gate itself still
# runs each segment from boot, because "the route works from a cold start" is
# the claim under test and a restore would quietly weaken it.
include walkthrough_05_cdrom.xit
include lib/save_as_ZZZZ.xit
